# Wails / frontend
# The frontend lives directly in ./ui (not ./ui/frontend). The compiled
# output.css and the auto-generated wailsjs bindings are committed so
# `go build -tags gui` works without a separate frontend build step or the
# wails CLI. Wails build output dir:
/build/
# If a node_modules ever lands under ui/ (e.g. for a richer frontend), ignore it:
/ui/node_modules/

# Node deps (commitlint + future lint tooling). package.json and
# package-lock.json are committed; node_modules is per-developer.
node_modules/

# Commitlint cache.
.commitlint-cache/

